tAgent-3hs\n65\tTitle: Fix checkpointing runtime gate failures after Azure/backtest blockers\n66\t```\n67\t\n68\t**Real verification target:** `e7723feb` (functional merge), not `e273f215` (bookkeeping).\n69\t\n70\t---\n71\t\n72\t## Failure Analysis\n73\t\n74\t### Step-level breakdown\n75\t\n76\t| Job | Step | Outcome | Duration |\n77\t|-----|------|---------|----------|\n78\t| CI (Lint + Tests) | All steps | success | ~3 min |\n79\t| Deploy to QA | Checkout | success | 1s |\n80\t| Deploy to QA | **Deploy to QA locally** | **failure** | ~8 min |\n81\t| Deploy to QA | Health check | skipped | — |\n82\t| Deploy to QA | Notify Hermes Tech Lead | success | 1s |\n83\t\n84\t### Root cause (log tail)\n85\t\n86\t```\n87\tStep 5/8 : COPY . .\n88\twrite /app/.worktrees/feature__QuantAgent-94d-add-backtest-run-id-isolation-to-activep/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/scipy/stats/__pycache__/_stats_py.cpython-311.pyc: no space left on device\n89\tService 'api' failed to build : Build failed\n90\t##[error]Process completed with exit code 1.\n91\t```\n92\t\n93\t**Failure signature:** `no space left on device` during Docker `COPY . .` step inside a worktree `.venv/`.\n94\t\n95\t---\n96\t\n97\t## Classification\n98\t\n99\t| Dimension | Value |\n100\t|-----------|-------|\n101\t| **Category** | Infraestructura / Docker capacity |\n102\t| **Subcategory** | Disk exhaustion during build |\n103\t| **Severity** | Non-blocking (transient) |\n104\t| **Scope** | Self-hosted runner host filesystem |\n105\t| **Code impact** | None — functional diff is sound |\n106\t\n107\t---\n108\t\n109\t## Infrastructure State Snapshot\n110\t\n111\t### Runner disk usage\n112\t\n113\t```bash\n114\tdf -h /\n115\tFilesystem      Size  Used Avail Use% Mounted on\n116\t/dev/root        61G   58G  3.7G  94% /\n117\t```\n118\t\n119\t**Root disk:** 94% full, 3.7 GB available.\n120\t\n121\t### Docker storage\n122\t\n123\t```bash\n124\tdocker system df\n125\tTYPE            TOTAL     ACTIVE    SIZE      RECLAIMABLE\